<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Absolute casserole.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/49/Absolute_casserole..png/revision/latest?cb=20210423022049\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Absolute casserole.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/49/Absolute_casserole..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210423022049\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/49/Absolute_casserole..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210423022049 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/4/49/Absolute_casserole..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210423022049 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Absolute casserole.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Absolute_casserole..png\" data-image-name=\"Absolute casserole..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\">11</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jamali_Maddix\" title=\"Jamali Maddix\">Jamali Maddix</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slap_and_tong.\" title=\"Slap and tong.\">Slap and tong.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/You%27ve_got_no_chutzpah.\" title=\"You&#39;ve got no chutzpah.\">You've got no chutzpah.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Absolute casserole.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\">Series 11</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 22 April 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Jamali_Maddix\" title=\"Jamali Maddix\">Jamali Maddix</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Absolute_casserole.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Absolute casserole\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Wozniak\" title=\"Mike Wozniak\">Mike Wozniak</a> described the state of his anus, having inadvertently squeezed out a haemorrhoid, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Fart\" title=\"Fart\">Fart</a> task. The title card is two paint palettes and a chip. The palettes are in reference to the two paint related tasks in the episode: <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_portrait_of_the_Taskmaster_on_this_door_only_using_your_feet\" title=\"Make the best portrait of the Taskmaster on this door only using your feet\">Make the best portrait of the Taskmaster on this door only using your feet</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vandalise_this_wall\" title=\"Vandalise this wall\">Vandalise this wall</a>, while the chip is derived from the <a href=\"/wiki/Identify_the_contents_of_the_battered_items\" title=\"Identify the contents of the battered items\">Identify the contents of the battered items</a> task, as the items the contestants had to identify were coated in batter \"from a fish and chips order\". Although unlikely, the red paint on the palettes could allude to Wozniak's haemorrhoid.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Absolute_casserole.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Ren kødgryde', which translates as 'Pure casserole'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Sekametelisoppa', which translates as 'Hotchpotch'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En förrädisk fis', which translates as 'A treacherous fart'. This is obviously also a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Wozniak\" title=\"Mike Wozniak\">Mike Wozniak</a>'s unfortunate experience during the <a href=\"/wiki/Fart\" title=\"Fart\">Fart</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Fullt kaos', which translates as 'Complete chaos'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Absolute_casserole.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Ritchie\" title=\"Charlotte Ritchie\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Charlotte Ritchie</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jamali_Maddix\" title=\"Jamali Maddix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jamali Maddix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lee_Mack\" title=\"Lee Mack\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lee Mack</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Wozniak\" title=\"Mike Wozniak\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mike Wozniak</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Kendall</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_annoying_thing\" title=\"Most annoying thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most annoying thing.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fart\" title=\"Fart\">S</a>\n</td>\n<td>Fart.\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td><b>1</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_portrait_of_the_Taskmaster_on_this_door_only_using_your_feet\" title=\"Make the best portrait of the Taskmaster on this door only using your feet\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best portrait of the Taskmaster on this door using only your feet.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vandalise_this_wall\" title=\"Vandalise this wall\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Vandalise this wall.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Identify_the_contents_of_the_battered_items\" title=\"Identify the contents of the battered items\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Identify the contents of the battered items in this fish and chips order. You may: lick and sniff all of the items, bite into two, squeeze one between your elbows, really stamp on one, look at one through a magnifying glass, and put one in a glass of water.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tie_the_very_ends_of_the_string_to_the_arms_of_the_glasses\" title=\"Tie the very ends of the string to the arms of the glasses\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Tie the very ends of the string to the arms of the glasses, then put the glasses on.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_as_many_rubber_bands_as_possible_into_Alex%27s_bum_bag\" title=\"Fire as many rubber bands as possible into Alex&#39;s bum bag\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Fire as many rubber bands as possible into Alex's bum bag.\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>17</b>\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Absolute_casserole.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notes\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This episode has two artistic tasks in a row.</li>\n<li>Jamali stamps on something in every recorded task in which he appears (aside from the tiebreaker), and in the live task.</li>\n<li><i>Absolute Casserole: The Taskmaster Compendium</i>, a guide to the first decade of <i>Taskmaster</i> released in 2024, was named after this episode.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Absolute_casserole.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://